---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

---
<BaseLayout
  title="Sporty — Free Adult Intake"
  description="Provide your measurements to get free sport matches tailored to your body."
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <style>
      .intake-layout {
        max-width: 960px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: grid;
        gap: 2rem;
        padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem) clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 3rem);
      }
      .intake-aside {
        background: rgba(14, 165, 165, 0.08);
        border: 1px solid rgba(14, 165, 165, 0.2);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        color: var(--color-muted);
      }
      .intake-grid {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.5rem;
      }
      .input-row {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      }
      label span {
        display: block;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-text);
        margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
      }
      input,
      select,
      textarea {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
        border-radius: 14px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.45);
        background: #fff;
        font: inherit;
      }
      textarea {
        min-height: 120px;
        resize: vertical;
      }
      fieldset {
        border: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0;
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
      }
      fieldset label {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.6rem;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }
      .premium-block {
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        padding-top: 1.5rem;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35);
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.5rem;
      }
      .premium-header {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.5rem;
      }
      .premium-header__badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.4rem;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-accent-dark);
      }
      .premium-groups {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.25rem;
      }
      .premium-group {
        border: 1px solid rgba(14, 165, 165, 0.25);
        background: rgba(14, 165, 165, 0.08);
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: clamp(1.1rem, 3vw, 1.6rem);
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
      }
      .premium-group__header {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .premium-group__header h3 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }
      .premium-count {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--color-muted);
      }
      .premium-group__items {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.9rem;
      }
      .premium-item {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
        align-items: end;
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 14px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.3);
        padding: 1rem;
      }
      .premium-item__note {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
      }
      .premium-empty {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--color-muted);
      }
      .premium-locked {
        border-radius: 16px;
        border: 1px dashed rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.4);
        padding: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 1.8rem);
        background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }
      .premium-locked strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
      }
      .premium-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }
      .premium-note {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--color-muted);
      }
      .privacy-note {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--color-muted);
      }
      .banner {
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
        background: rgba(14, 165, 165, 0.12);
        border: 1px solid rgba(14, 165, 165, 0.2);
        color: var(--color-accent-dark);
      }
      .banner strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
      }
      .card {
        padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
      }
    </style>
  </Fragment>

  <main class="intake-layout">
    <section class="banner" aria-live="polite">
      <strong>Free adult quick match</strong>
      <span data-intake-banner>Share a handful of measurements and we’ll return your top three sports instantly. Log in and consent to save your results for later.</span>
    </section>

    <form class="card" data-intake-form>
      <h1 class="section__title" style="margin-bottom:0.5rem">Tell us about your body</h1>
      <p class="lead-copy" style="margin-top:0">Take less than a minute to complete. Optional measurements tighten the match.</p>

      <div class="intake-grid" role="group" aria-labelledby="basic-info">
        <h2 id="basic-info" class="section__subtitle" style="margin-bottom:0">Basic info</h2>
        <div class="input-row">
          <label>
            <span>Birthday</span>
            <input type="date" name="birthday" required />
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>Sex assigned at birth</span>
            <select name="sex" required>
              <option value="">Select one</option>
              <option value="female">Female</option>
              <option value="male">Male</option>
            </select>
          </label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="intake-grid" role="group" aria-labelledby="measurements">
        <h2 id="measurements" class="section__subtitle" style="margin-bottom:0">Measurements</h2>
        <div class="input-row">
          <label>
            <span>Height (cm)</span>
            <input type="number" name="height_cm" min="120" max="230" required inputmode="decimal" />
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>Weight (kg)</span>
            <input type="number" name="weight_kg" min="35" max="200" required inputmode="decimal" />
          </label>
        </div>
        <div class="input-row">
          <label>
            <span>Arm span (cm)</span>
            <input type="number" name="arm_span_cm" min="100" max="250" inputmode="decimal" />
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>Leg inseam (cm)</span>
            <input type="number" name="leg_inseam_cm" min="50" max="130" inputmode="decimal" />
          </label>
        </div>
        <div class="input-row">
          <label>
            <span>Shoulder width (cm)</span>
            <input type="number" name="shoulder_width_cm" min="30" max="80" inputmode="decimal" />
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>Hip width (cm)</span>
            <input type="number" name="hip_width_cm" min="30" max="80" inputmode="decimal" />
          </label>
        </div>
        <div class="input-row">
          <label>
            <span>Hand length (cm)</span>
            <input type="number" name="hand_length_cm" min="10" max="30" inputmode="decimal" />
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>Foot length (cm)</span>
            <input type="number" name="foot_length_cm" min="15" max="35" inputmode="decimal" />
          </label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="premium-locked" data-premium-locked hidden>
        <strong>Detailed analysis inputs</strong>
        <p data-premium-locked-message>
          Premium credits let you capture preferences, goals, and injuries alongside your measurements.
          Sign in and apply a credit to unlock deeper tailoring.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="premium-block" data-premium-block hidden>
        <div class="premium-header">
          <span class="premium-header__badge">Premium analysis</span>
          <h2 class="section__subtitle" style="margin:0;">Tell us what matters most</h2>
          <p class="lead-copy" style="margin:0;">Add up to 20 entries per category. We’ll blend these with your measurements for the detailed analysis.</p>
          <p class="premium-note" data-premium-summary></p>
        </div>
        <div class="premium-groups">
          <div class="premium-group" data-list="preferences">
            <div class="premium-group__header">
              <div>
                <h3>Preferences</h3>
                <p class="premium-note">Training environments, team dynamics, or settings you gravitate toward.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="premium-actions">
                <span class="premium-count" data-count>0 / 20</span>
                <button type="button" class="button--ghost button--sm" data-add="preference">Add preference</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="premium-group__items" data-items></div>
            <p class="premium-empty" data-empty>None added yet. Add up to 20 preferences.</p>
            <template data-template>
              <div class="premium-item" data-item>
                <label>
                  <span>Preference</span>
                  <select data-field="preference_id" required></select>
                </label>
                <label>
                  <span>Priority</span>
                  <select data-field="priority">
                    <option value="must_have">Must-have</option>
                    <option value="nice_to_have">Nice-to-have</option>
                  </select>
                </label>
                <button type="button" class="button--ghost button--sm" data-remove>Remove</button>
              </div>
            </template>
          </div>

          <div class="premium-group" data-list="goals">
            <div class="premium-group__header">
              <div>
                <h3>Goals</h3>
                <p class="premium-note">What you want sport to deliver—skills, fitness, or lifestyle outcomes.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="premium-actions">
                <span class="premium-count" data-count>0 / 20</span>
                <button type="button" class="button--ghost button--sm" data-add="goal">Add goal</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="premium-group__items" data-items></div>
            <p class="premium-empty" data-empty>None added yet. Add up to 20 goals.</p>
            <template data-template>
              <div class="premium-item" data-item>
                <label>
                  <span>Goal</span>
                  <select data-field="goal_id" required></select>
                </label>
                <label>
                  <span>Priority</span>
                  <select data-field="priority">
                    <option value="must_have">Must-have</option>
                    <option value="nice_to_have">Nice-to-have</option>
                  </select>
                </label>
                <button type="button" class="button--ghost button--sm" data-remove>Remove</button>
              </div>
            </template>
          </div>

          <div class="premium-group" data-list="injuries">
            <div class="premium-group__header">
              <div>
                <h3>Injuries</h3>
                <p class="premium-note">Flag current or past injuries so we can adjust intensity and recommendations.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="premium-actions">
                <span class="premium-count" data-count>0 / 20</span>
                <button type="button" class="button--ghost button--sm" data-add="injury">Add injury</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="premium-group__items" data-items></div>
            <p class="premium-empty" data-empty>None added yet. Add up to 20 injuries.</p>
            <template data-template>
              <div class="premium-item" data-item>
                <label>
                  <span>Injury</span>
                  <select data-field="injury_id" required></select>
                </label>
                <label>
                  <span>Specific area</span>
                  <select data-field="injury_subcategory_id">
                    <option value="">General</option>
                  </select>
                </label>
                <label>
                  <span>Severity</span>
                  <select data-field="severity">
                    <option value="severe">Severe</option>
                    <option value="somewhat_bad">Somewhat bad</option>
                    <option value="mostly_healed">Mostly healed</option>
                  </select>
                </label>
                <label class="premium-item__note">
                  <span>Notes (optional)</span>
                  <input type="text" data-field="notes" maxlength="160" placeholder="Rehab status, triggers, limits" />
                </label>
                <button type="button" class="button--ghost button--sm" data-remove>Remove</button>
              </div>
            </template>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="form-actions">
        <p class="privacy-note">We don’t store your data unless you log in and consent. Measurements sent to the backend are processed securely.</p>
        <div data-status aria-live="polite"></div>
        <div class="button-row">
          <button class="button" type="submit" data-submit>Get my matches</button>
          <a class="button--ghost" href="/privacy">Privacy policy (draft)</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </form>

    <aside class="intake-aside">
      <h2 class="section__subtitle" style="margin-top:0;">Tips for accurate measuring</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Use a flexible measuring tape and stand tall without shoes.</li>
        <li>Arm span: fingertip to fingertip, arms extended level with shoulders.</li>
        <li>Leg inseam: heel to inner thigh crease (use a book to mark the spot).</li>
        <li>Shoulder width: outer edge to outer edge of shoulders.</li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div>
        <strong>Need help measuring?</strong>
        <p class="lead-copy">We’ll add video guides soon. For now, keep a flexible measuring tape handy and stand tall without shoes.</p>
      </div>
      <small>© <span id="year">2025</span> Sporty</small>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <Fragment slot="scripts">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2" defer></script>
    <script src="/config.js" defer></script>
    <script src="/assets/js/app.js" defer></script>
    <script src="/assets/js/intake.js" defer></script>
    <script>
      const yearEl = document.getElementById('year');
    if (yearEl) {
      yearEl.textContent = String(new Date().getFullYear());
    }
    </script>
  </Fragment>
</BaseLayout>
